synopsis: Support `MultiVerb` endpoints behind `Auth`
packages: servant-auth-server
prs: #1922
description: {
  `servant-auth-server` now adds its `Set-Cookie` headers to `MultiVerb`
  endpoints behind `Auth`. Each response of such an endpoint gets an optional
  `Set-Cookie` header. Before, an API with a `MultiVerb` endpoint under `Auth`
  did not compile, because `AddSetCookieApi` and `AddSetCookies` had no
  instances for `MultiVerb`.

  The handler of such an endpoint is written as before; `Auth` pairs its
  result with the cookie.
}
